1275
01:55:01.520 --> 01:55:04.859
Rev. David Schwartz (he/him): And in that place, which is not a place.

1276
01:55:05.610 --> 01:55:08.830
Rev. David Schwartz (he/him): It doesn't think of the soul horde it kept.

1277
01:55:10.150 --> 01:55:15.289
Rev. David Schwartz (he/him): But of the teacher who found it as a lost child and loved it into speech.

1278
01:55:17.590 --> 01:55:22.180
Rev. David Schwartz (he/him): And finally… Finally.

1279
01:55:22.530 --> 01:55:29.840
